{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警方在尖沙咀截查一架私家車，檢獲少量懷疑大麻，司機被捕。</p><p></p><p>昨晚十一時許，交通警員在碧仙桃路與麼地道交界截停一輛行車不穩的私家車，在車內檢獲半枝懷疑大麻，緝毒犬奉召到場協助搜查。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DRUG.CAR-0200_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fZXB0ZG1nA1792358755.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>36歲男司機未能通過快速口腔液測試，涉嫌藥後駕駛、管有危險藥物及外出時沒有攜帶身份證明文件被捕。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DRUG.CAR-0200_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026S2TSqvj8GR1792358759.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T21:38:47.598986+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T21:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T01:37:45.086756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T21:37:33.808537+00:00","content_hash":"3901165efdec4b79bd5cd40b83dd3696808b2fb0f34eeebfc39726c739bc6b3b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}